@startuml
actor Faculty
actor Manager
participant "main.cpp / Menu" as Main
participant LeaveSystem as System
participant LeaveRequest as Request
participant Approval
participant FileManager as Files
Faculty -> Main : choose Main Transaction
Main -> System : processTransaction()
System -> Request : validate dates / calculateDays()
Request --> System : duration and status
System --> Faculty : request ID and duration
Manager -> Main : approve or reject request
Main -> System : processTransaction()
System -> Approval : create approval record
System -> Request : update status
System -> Files : save() on exit
Files --> System : records written
@enduml
